    'Renting Local vs. the Big Rental Companies in South Florida',
    'renting-local-vs-big-rental-companies',
    'Debit card? Want to pay over time with Affirm? Already have car insurance? Here''s how renting from a local, family-owned company in Fort Lauderdale and Miami compares with Enterprise, Hertz, Alamo, Avis and the other big names.',
    $json${"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"When most people book a rental car, they go straight to the names they already know: Enterprise, Hertz, Alamo, Avis, Budget, National, Sixt, Dollar, Thrifty. Those companies are everywhere, and that's exactly why they come to mind first."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"But if you're flying into Fort Lauderdale or Miami, taking a cruise out of Port Everglades or PortMiami, or need a car while yours is in the shop, you have another option: a local, family-owned rental company."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We're Rent With Heldy. We've put together an honest look at how renting local compares, so you can decide what fits your trip."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pay with a debit card"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A lot of travelers don't use credit cards. Some prefer to keep their spending on a debit card. Some are younger and haven't built credit yet. Some simply don't want another hold sitting on their card for a week."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"At the big rental counters, a debit card can be complicated. Policies vary by company and location, and at airport counters they often come with extra requirements, such as showing a return flight, passing a credit check, or leaving a larger hold. It's worth reading the fine print before you get to the counter."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"At Rent With Heldy, we accept debit cards.","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" No guessing whether the counter will say yes when you land."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pay over time with Affirm"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Family vacations, long stays and cruise trips add up quickly. We offer "},{"type":"text","text":"Affirm","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":", so you can split the cost of your rental into payments instead of paying it all at once."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Affirm shows you what you'll owe before you commit, and you can check your options at checkout. It's one less thing to stretch your budget on a trip that should feel relaxing."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Bring your own insurance"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If you already have car insurance, you may not need to buy extra coverage at the counter. With us, you can "},{"type":"text","text":"bring your own insurance","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Just show proof of coverage when you book."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Prefer not to use your own policy? You can choose a protection plan through our booking platform instead. Either way, you'll know what you're covered by before you drive away."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A quick tip: call your insurance company before your trip and ask whether your policy covers rental cars in Florida. It's a five-minute call that can save you money."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"You get the car you booked"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The big companies usually rent you a "},{"type":"text","text":"class","marks":[{"type":"italic"}]},{"type":"text","text":" of car, like \"midsize SUV or similar.\" You find out what you're actually driving when you get to the lot."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"When you "},{"type":"text","text":"browse our fleet","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"/book"}}]},{"type":"text","text":", you see the real vehicle, with real photos and the actual price for your dates. The car you pick is the car we hand you."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"We meet you where you are"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Airport rental counters mean shuttle buses, long lines and a walk through a parking garage after a long flight."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"With a local company, the car can come to you:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Flying in?","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Share your flight number and we'll plan around your arrival at "},{"type":"text","text":"Fort Lauderdale-Hollywood International (FLL)","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"/fort-lauderdale-airport-car-rental"}}]},{"type":"text","text":" or Miami International (MIA), including delays."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Staying at a hotel?","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" We can "},{"type":"text","text":"meet you at your hotel","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"/hotel-concierge-rentals"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Taking a cruise?","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" We'll have a car ready for your "},{"type":"text","text":"cruise port trip","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"/cruise-port-delivery"}}]},{"type":"text","text":" before or after you sail."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Car in the shop?","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" We work with body shops on "},{"type":"text","text":"replacement rentals","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"/body-shop-delivery"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Contactless pickup is available too, so you can pick up the car on your own schedule."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Clear, simple pricing"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Rental prices at big airport counters often grow once taxes, airport fees, add-ons and young-driver charges are added. Those charges are real, but they can be hard to see until checkout."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We keep it simple. You see your price when you book. Tolls are billed at cost at the end of your trip, with no extra toll fees on top."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"You talk to a real person"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"When your flight is delayed or you need an extra day, calling a national 1-800 number can mean long holds and scripted answers."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"With us, you message the same local team that's handling your rental. Running late? Let us know. Need to extend? Message us early, and if the car isn't already booked, we'll keep you in it."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"When the big companies might be the better fit"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"We want you to have the right car for your trip, even if it isn't ours."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A national company can make more sense if you're planning a one-way trip to another state, need to pick up in a city we don't serve, or want to use a corporate account or loyalty points."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"For trips in and around Fort Lauderdale, Miami, Hollywood and Aventura, a local company is often the easier choice."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Quick comparison"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Rent With Heldy"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Big rental companies"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Debit cards"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Accepted"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Varies; often extra requirements at airports"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pay over time"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Affirm available"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Rarely offered"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Your own insurance"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Welcome"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Usually accepted, with upsells at the counter"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Vehicle"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The exact car you booked"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A class of car, \"or similar\""}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pickup"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Airport, hotel, cruise port or delivery"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Counter or shuttle to the lot"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Who you talk to"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Our local team"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","attrs":{"colspan":1,"rowspan":1,"colwidth":null},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A national call center"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ready when you are"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"If you're heading to South Florida, we'd love to take care of your trip. "},{"type":"text","text":"Browse available cars","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"/book"}}]},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"text","text":"contact us","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"/contact"}}]},{"type":"text","text":" with any questions. You'll reach a real person."}]}]}$json$::jsonb,
